# #5833. foreignHigh attributes every PreArm append to the claimant, so another
# activation's PreArm append is never counted. It edits an operator, not an action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestForeignHighIgnoresOtherToken
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: foreignHigh attributes every PreArm append to the claimant

--- FIND
    Max({startHead - 1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: PreArm appends are taken as the claimant's own.
    Max({startHead - 1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ o \notin preArm /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}}
--- END
